      "reason": "All four files listener.rs, unix/tcp.rs, unix/net.rs, unix/mod.rs are byte-identical between1.0.1 and1.0.2. Every extracted function is identical between1.0.2 and1.0.3 except socket_addr adds only a Hermit cfg for sin6_len. On Linux that added cfg is inactive.",
